  "stac_version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "The Integrated Multi-satellitE Retrievals for GPM (IMERG) algorithm fuses information from \nthe GPM satellite constellation to estimate precipitation over the majority of the Earth's surface.\n\nThis dataset is the 'Early' run, provided by NASA and hosted by NTU CompHydroMet Lab.\n\n**Methodology**:\nIMERG unifies precipitation estimates from the GPM constellation...\n\n**Known Issues**:\n- Early run data may have higher latency...\n",
